# Store and check out every text file with LF, whatever the contributor's
# core.autocrlf happens to be. `text=auto` still detects binaries correctly, so
# there is nothing to list here per file type.
#
# This matters beyond tidiness: a hook script that reaches Linux or macOS with
# CRLF line endings fails on its shebang line, and the failure reads as a
# missing interpreter rather than a line-ending problem.
* text=auto eol=lf
